{"ticker":"DOV","updated":"2026-10-30T22:45:03Z","profile":{"longName":"Dover Corporation","shortName":"Dover Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dovercorporation.com","fullTimeEmployees":24000,"marketCap":27629557760,"trailingPE":24.240376,"forwardPE":17.632624,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.221519,"pegRatio":1.42,"targetMeanPrice":238.78947,"targetHighPrice":284.0,"targetLowPrice":178.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.075,"earningsGrowth":0.129,"grossMargins":0.40228,"operatingMargins":0.19658001,"profitMargins":0.13596,"totalRevenue":8576562176,"beta":1.126,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":237.54,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":176.4,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.0},"summary":"Dover Corporation provides equipment and components, consumable supplies, aftermarket parts, software and digital solutions, and support services worldwide. The company's Engineered Products segment provides various equipment, component, software, solution, and services that are used in vehicle aftermarket, aerospace and defense, industrial winch and hoist, and fluid dispensing end-market. This segment offers software solutions and services used in light and heavy-duty vehicle lifts, wheel service equipment, vehicle diagnostics, and vehicle collision repair solutions; winches, hoists, bearings, drives, and electric monitoring system; and radio frequency and microwave filters and switches, and signal intelligence solutions, as well as soldering and fluid dispensing solutions. Its Clean Energy & Fueling segment offers component, equipment, and software and service solution enabling safe storage and transport of fuel, cryogenic gases, and hazardous fluids, as well as operation of retail fueling and vehicle wash establishment. The company's Imaging & Identification segment provides precision marking and coding, product traceability equipment, brand protection, and digital textile printing equipment and solution, as well as consumable, software, and service to packaged and consumer goods, pharmaceutical, industrial manufacturing, textile, and other end-market. Its Pumps & Process So","summary_zh":"Dover Corporation 在全球提供設備和組件、消耗品、售後零件、軟體和數位解決方案以及支援服務。該公司的工程產品部門提供用於汽車售後市場、航空航太和國防、工業絞車和起重機以及流體分配終端市場的各種設備、組件、軟體、解決方案和服務。該部門提供輕型和重型車輛舉昇機、車輪服務設備、車輛診斷和車輛碰撞修復解決方案的軟體解決方案和服務；絞車、提昇機、軸承、驅動器和電氣監控系統；射頻和微波濾波器和開關、訊號智慧解決方案以及焊接和流體點膠解決方案。其清潔能源和加油部門提供組件、設備、軟體和服務解決方案，實現燃料、低溫氣體和危險液體的安全儲存和運輸，以及零售加油和洗車設施的運作。該公司的成像和識別部門為包裝和消費品、製藥、工業製造、紡織和其他終端市場提供精密標記和編碼、產品可追溯設備、品牌保護和數位紡織印刷設備和解決方案，以及耗材、軟體和服務。其泵浦和製程系統","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":176.7,"h":176.81,"l":174.38,"c":175.77,"v":955400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":175.49,"h":175.99,"l":173.96,"c":174.73,"v":724100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":174.74,"h":178.4,"l":174.26,"c":178.36,"v":771600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":178.96,"h":180.48,"l":176.6,"c":177.75,"v":1047500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":177.77,"h":178.63,"l":175.82,"c":178.0,"v":1136100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":177.52,"h":177.52,"l":174.05,"c":174.68,"v":764700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":175.19,"h":177.86,"l":174.94,"c":175.64,"v":882300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":175.79,"h":178.61,"l":175.79,"c":178.1,"v":1031800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":177.45,"h":177.6,"l":172.88,"c":172.98,"v":1133100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":173.11,"h":173.86,"l":171.69,"c":171.94,"v":742900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":171.9,"h":172.86,"l":171.04,"c":172.57,"v":947300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":173.24,"h":175.81,"l":170.38,"c":171.45,"v":720400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":172.68,"h":174.37,"l":171.92,"c":172.8,"v":831400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":173.15,"h":173.56,"l":170.89,"c":171.34,"v":1492700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":170.35,"h":170.95,"l":169.52,"c":170.24,"v":855500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":171.34,"h":172.26,"l":168.49,"c":169.09,"v":1133200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":169.07,"h":169.75,"l":167.04,"c":167.29,"v":1205900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":166.08,"h":166.45,"l":163.7,"